{
  "description": "Temporary installation of non-illuminated vinyl lettering to the external face of the existing ground-floor shopfront windows at 1 Upper St. Martin's Lane,\ndisplaying the business name “Nancy Spains”, the year of opening “2027”, and the company mission statement \"bringing the craic, one tune,\none pint, one city at a time\".\nThe vinyl will be applied to timber panels installed over the window panes and will cover 100% of the 5 no. windows. Lettering will be gold on a\ngreen background, with a maximum letter height of 240mm and an overall graphic size of approximately 3200 mm x 3250mm and 2000mm x\n3250mm per window.\nNo illumination, no projecting elements, and no alterations to the shopfront, window frames or building fabric are proposed. The vinyl is fully\nremovable without damage to the glazing. There is no change of use.",
